     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-vagrant/pull/19\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-vagrant/pull/19</a></p>\n\n<p>Additionally, the following snapshot pre-releases have been created:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/releases/tag/fcrepo-4.3.1-SNAPSHOT\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/releases/tag/fcrepo-4.3.1-SNAPSHOT</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-webapp-plus/releases/tag/fcrepo-webapp-plus-4.3.1-SNAPSHOT\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-webapp-plus/releases/tag/fcrepo-webapp-plus-4.3.1-SNAPSHOT</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/releases/tag/fcrepo-camel-toolbox-4.3.1-SNAPSHOT\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/releases/tag/fcrepo-camel-toolbox-4.3.1-SNAPSHOT</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
