       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Jared Whiklo",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This might be expected behaviour but I haven't play with fcrepo-webapp-plus much.<br/>\nIn install_scripts/config, setting<br/>\naudit=true<br/>\nauth=true<br/>\nyou can only access the instance with the admin user ID, nothing is indexed to Solr and only audit events end up in Fuseki.</p>\n\n<p>Log shows some errors</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>ERROR 01:47:57.544 (default) Could not dispatch event: org.fcrepo.audit.InternalAuditor@5facde23 to public void \r\norg.fcrepo.audit.InternalAuditor.recordEvent(org.fcrepo.kernel.api.observer.FedoraEvent) throws \r\norg.fcrepo.kernel.api.exception.RepositoryRuntimeException\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Probably not related to this ticket, but thought I would point it out before merging.</p>",
     "created": "24/Aug/15 10:58 PM",
